// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P154364275" "Hey, I've been hearing rumors that Crey is covering up the fact that one of their labs was taken over by Rikti a couple days ago. It's one of their facilities in Crey's Folly. This might be a good opportunity to learn something more about Crey, or better yet, about what the Rikti's next move is. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you investigate that Crey lab?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1619918683" "Investigate the Crey Lab"
// SendOffString :
"P1975717419" "Crey denies any of this, of course, but I have a hunch there is some truth to this rumor."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3974663424" "Defeat all Rikti in lab"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4137722623" "Crey is still adamantly denying the rumor that their lab has been overrun by Rikti for days now."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1731506368" "The secure locks to the doors are busted, revealing that there may be some truth to the rumor that this lab has been overrun by Rikti."

