// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3427928410" "I got a report here that the Brickstown Infirmary had their entire supply of blood stolen right out of their storage facility. The only sign of forced entry was through a liquid waste disposal chute, so I think it's safe to assume the perps came in through the sewers. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>They can't treat any patients until someone recovers that stolen blood.</A> Can you help them out?"
// AcceptString :
"P2995588430" "Recover stolen blood"
// SendOffString :
"P3826534581" "I think they should probably still be in the sewers, try this entrance to track them down."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1380832903" "Brickstown Infirmary is in dire straights, you need to find that blood."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1528565674" "A popped bag of blood on the ground tells you that you are hot on their trail."

