// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - DrSnider 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P778517652" "Dr. Snider"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2561294713" "Thank you so much! I have to tell you something!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P469773059" "You have rescued Dr. Snider."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1243201456" "Dr. Snider thanks you for saving his life. I must say, his story is pretty strange. Performing organ transplants on Rikti soldiers? I wonder what that's all about."
// RandomFameString :
"P2852859190" "Dr. Snider performed an emergency heart transplant today. That patient would have died if Snider wasn't saved by {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2831530644" "I've done a little digging. There's a rumor that all Rikti bodies are taken to a secret SERAPH lab for analysis. Makes sense, I guess. I have a good friend over at SERAPH, Rebecca Brinell. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Go see her; maybe she can tell you more about the Rikti's recent organ thefts.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3297328114" "Go see Rebecca Brinell"
// SendOffString :
"P1395775042" "She's over in Atlas Park now, working with SERAPH."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound6_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1769706396" "Talk to Rebecca Brinell"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1141442639" "Rebecca should be expecting you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1830493130" "{ContactName} called and said you would be by. SERAPH does indeed have a lab where dead Rikti are examined, but it's not like we end up with every single one. I've pulled a couple strings and have secured you a visitor's pass to the facility. Perhaps our techs there can point you in the right direction."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound6_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3575671263" "So the rumor has some truth to it, eh? Don't they all. You should use that pass to go visit the lab and find out what you can."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2682163182" "The sounds of plasma fire make it apparent that the Rikti have learned the location of this secret lab."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostages 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P2685553112" "SERAPH Scientist"
// Description :
"P798116157" "scientists remaining"
// SingularDescription :
"P159809516" "Save the last scientist!"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1856282364" "Thanks, {Rescuer}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P683203864" "You have cleared the lab of Rikti and rescued the hostages."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3785164379" "Sorry you didn't get any solid info on Rikti biology. We'll just have to keep digging if we want to know what they want with those human organs. At least you saved the day over at that secret SERAPH lab! It never hurts to impress the big boys, {HeroName}. "

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Errand7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3796834367" "I just got a call from Rebecca Brinell over at SERAPH. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>She says she wants you to visit her right away.</A> She couldn't discuss her news on the phone, but I'm hoping it's a lead on this Rikti plot we've been investigating. We need to know what those aliens are doing with those stolen human organs!"
// SendOffString :
"P1873881278" "I don't know what its about, but Rebecca said you would really like it."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P528446068" "Rebecca is wondering when you are going to visit her."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1180189226" "I wanted to tell you that the Federal Bureau of Super-powered Affairs was very happy with your help in saving that SERAPH lab. Months of Rikti research was almost wiped out entirely, and we have you to thank for saving it. It took a call from the Vice President, and a background check, but you now have Omega clearance! I can tell you what SERAPH has learned from analyzing the Rikti. Are you ready for this?<br><br>Rikti are humans. Biologically, they're not aliens at all, just highly mutated human beings. That means that the Rikti homeworld is not another planet, but an alternate Earth. You can imagine the panic if this was to get out. Not like anyone would really believe it though.<br><br>One thing we aren't sure of is if the Rikti themselves know this fact. If they did, they would most likely try to use it to their advantage somehow."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1908927440" "So you can't talk about what she told you, eh? From the way you're acting I can imagine it was really juicy. Don't go breaking your code clearance on my account. Now, back to this problem with the Rikti organ thefts. I wonder what's going on there?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound8 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1542571322" "<A HREF={ACCEPT}>I think you need to hit the streets again with Weintraub's Psychic Probe.</A> I've set it to probe for information on organs. Just defeat as many Rikti as you can find; sooner or later one of them has to have some information on  those stolen human organs."
// AcceptString :
"P1309830667" "Hit the streets with Weintraub's Psychic Probe"
// SendOffString :
"P1361806866" "Not all the Rikti will be informed on what their plans are with the organs, so you might have to defeat quite a few."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound8_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4214921100" "That probe of Marvin's needs the Rikti to be defeated in order to work. So start kicking some butt!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1616648958" "The probe beeps. It knows the location of a hidden Rikti base."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound8_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2631037706" "Investigate Rikti base"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1739810904" "You got the location of a Rikti base? It must have something to do with the human organs they've been stealing. Follow up on it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P540136458" "This base looks like the Rikti have been here a while."

