"P2253506238" "You found that the unit contains mutating human organs."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P469745618" "You have shut down the Rikti organ transplanting operation."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1450735293" "Here's the Psychic Probe."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P173132996" "So, the Rikti burn out their own organs, possibly by overworking themselves during combat. It's still hard to believe that they were trying to replace their organs with mutated human ones! I can't see how that could work, them being aliens and all. {HeroName}, you did a great job stopping them before their plan could come to fruition."
// RandomFameString :
"P1635518281" "I heard that the Rikti were harvesting human organs, but {HeroName} stopped them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
